
  [1m[38;5;153mapp.js[0m — [38;5;153mlogin[39m keeps its [38;5;153m(username, password)[39m signature and gains a [38;5;153muserId[39m in its return value:

  [34mfunction[39m [33mlogin[39m(username, password) {
